AlkylationReagent: iodoacetamide
CellLine: HCC1599
CellLine: MCF7
CellLine: HCC1937
CellLine: HCC2218
CellType: Human mammary epithelial cells (HMEC)
CleavageAgent: Sequencing grade trypsin
Disease: breast tumours
FactorValue: ERPR tumours
FactorValue: Her2
FactorValue: TN
FractionationMethod: strong anion exchange chromatography in a StageTip format
FragmentMassTolerance: 20 p.p.m.
FragmentationMethod: Higher energy collisional dissociation
GradientTime: 200-min water-acetonitrile gradient
Instrument: Q Exactive mass spectrometer (Thermo Scientific)
IonizationType: nano-electrospray ion source
Label: Stable Isotope Labelling with Amino Acids in Cell Culture
Label: super-SILAC
Label: 13C615N4-arginine (Arg-10)
Label: l-13C615N2-lysine (Lys-8)
MaterialType: cell line
MaterialType: tissue
Modification: methionine oxidation
Modification: N-terminal acetylation
Modification: carbamidomethyl cysteine
NumberOfFractions: six fractions
NumberOfSamples: Forty breast tumour samples
Organism: Human
PooledSample: pooled
PrecursorMassTolerance: maximal initial mass deviation of 6 p.p.m.
ReductionReagent: DTT
Separation: in-house made 30-cm-reverse phase columns (75 mum inner diameter, 1.8 mum ReproSil-Pur C18 beads) on an EASY-nLC nano high performance liquid chromatography system (Thermo Scientific)
Staining: hematoxylin and eosin staining
